  "description": "Do-Yun is an ordinary person. He's a faceless, part-time fitting model to be exact.\n\nBut one day... While he's enjoying his free time on a Saturday afternoon, he gets a request from his friend Chang-Hyeok, a gaming streamer, to participate in a 'broadcast collab' at his place. However...\n\n\\[I told you to shut up, you b\\*stards! It's too loud.\\]\n“… … .”\n\nThe atmosphere of the broadcast is not normal. Will Do-Yun be able to finish the broadcast safely? \n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)\n\n*(Note: This is a one-shot promotional webtoon for the web novel of the same name.*",
